# ClamAV's root-context build is deny-by-default: never send repository secrets/assets.
**
!infra/
!infra/clamav/
!infra/clamav/worker/
!infra/clamav/worker/**
!infra/clamav/clamd.conf
!infra/clamav/healthcheck.mjs
!infra/clamav/tests/
!infra/clamav/tests/genuine.test.mjs
!supabase/
!supabase/functions/
!supabase/functions/_shared/
!supabase/functions/_shared/attachmentSafety.ts
!supabase/functions/_shared/zipValidation.ts
!supabase/functions/_shared/clamavPolicy.ts
**/.env*
**/*.log
